@startuml
title Transport Order- High Level View

box "Wholebuyer" #E0E0E0
  participant "BuyerGW" as BuyerGW
end box
box "Wholeseller" #E0E0E0
  participant "SellerGW" as SellerGW
end box

== Transport Product Offering Qualification ==

note over BuyerGW, SellerGW : Qualification for eligible products

BuyerGW -> SellerGW : 1 Find products - TMF 679 Product Qualification
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 2 List of eligible product specs with their Supporting Resources (Transport + ENNIs)

== Transport Order ==

note over BuyerGW, SellerGW : Order can be placed

BuyerGW -> SellerGW : 3 Place order - TMF 622 Product Order adding under Transport the Supporting Resource (ENNI)
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 4 Order Created Event "acknowledged"
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 5 Order State Update Event "accepted"
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 6 Order State Update Event "inProgress"
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 7 Order State Update Event "complete"

@enduml
